      "updated": 1793600643747,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "解释 sector 前，先对齐“相同有效数据量”\n32 lane × 4 byte = 128 byte → 对齐时覆盖 4 个 32-byte sector\n32 lane × 16 byte = 512 byte → 对齐时覆盖 16 个 32-byte sector",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "解释 sector 前，先对齐“相同有效数据量”\n32 lane × 4 byte = 128 byte → 对齐时覆盖 4 个 32-byte sector\n32 lane × 16 byte = 512 byte → 对齐时覆盖 16 个 32-byte sector",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
